From: shota <monyuonyu@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 08:38:32 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 049/108] Translations: plain Japanese for fitting and aligning
 the view

"Fit all", "Fit selection", "Align to selection", "Draw style" and
"Standard views" say what they do in everyday words (show everything,
show what is picked, look straight at the picked face, ...).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
